{"2995260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Depth Diver", "steam_appid": 2995260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4319440], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/0d3aedabb6ea2969d2f06664c9a88c15.avif?t=1782934284\" width=432 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear the deep. Whether you suffer from thalassophobia, claustrophobia, or a sheer terror of the unknown, the dark waters of Gornak will drag you into an unforgiving underwater <strong>nightmare</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/f01b9e0b6f84d5973172046c2b6fd255.webp?t=1782934284\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the abyss to repair decaying underwater infrastructures. You have a sentence to serve and a debt to pay. Risk your life to complete dangerous missions for the Union: fix broken pipes, replace highly defective equipment, and even gather the scattered body parts of those who failed before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/970ee505d90005b3de6302d6adb05a79.avif?t=1782934284\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/fcd272dbbbed4ead55cfb1a6e73c582d.webp?t=1782934284\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the dark. You will inevitably encounter the local fauna... and they are <i>hungry</i>. Pray to Stiska for your survival, and take refuge in your only safe haven: <strong>a magnificent, cutting-edge Gornacian submarine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/bd78f7e73344a1473e7fe234355b0180.poster.avif?t=1782934284\" width=944 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/bd78f7e73344a1473e7fe234355b0180.webm?t=1782934284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/bd78f7e73344a1473e7fe234355b0180.mp4?t=1782934284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/5c730db74956398c6e48712436eff097.webp?t=1782934284\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive with a crew of friends and pray you aren't the last one <strong>drowning</strong> when things inevitably go wrong. Prefer to dive solo? The Gornacian Metallurgical Union will provide minimal support to prevent your gruesome death. After all, they care deeply about you... or rather, they care about preventing the tragic loss of a very expensive submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.poster.avif?t=1782934284\" width=480 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.webm?t=1782934284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.mp4?t=1782934284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/0d3aedabb6ea2969d2f06664c9a88c15.avif?t=1782934284\" width=432 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear the deep. Whether you suffer from thalassophobia, claustrophobia, or a sheer terror of the unknown, the dark waters of Gornak will drag you into an unforgiving underwater <strong>nightmare</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/f01b9e0b6f84d5973172046c2b6fd255.webp?t=1782934284\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the abyss to repair decaying underwater infrastructures. You have a sentence to serve and a debt to pay. Risk your life to complete dangerous missions for the Union: fix broken pipes, replace highly defective equipment, and even gather the scattered body parts of those who failed before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/970ee505d90005b3de6302d6adb05a79.avif?t=1782934284\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/fcd272dbbbed4ead55cfb1a6e73c582d.webp?t=1782934284\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the dark. You will inevitably encounter the local fauna... and they are <i>hungry</i>. Pray to Stiska for your survival, and take refuge in your only safe haven: <strong>a magnificent, cutting-edge Gornacian submarine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\